OL,3,GNEWSALuxury cruise passengers stranded
OL,4,Ain Cambodia due to soaring fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlobal fuel prices have soared since
OL,7,Fthe Iran war started earlier this year.
OL,8,FThe ship's operator said the monthly
OL,9,Ffuel cost per cabin in parts of Asia
OL,10,Fhas risen to as much as $8,000 (#6,000)
OL,11,Ffrom $1,800.
